    {
      "text": "CTCAC CA-26-443: VTA Capitol Station, located at West Capitol Expressway and Narvaez Avenue in San Jose on a 2.68 acre site, requested and is being recommended for a reservation of $6,572,158 in annual federal tax credits, $15,925,764 in total state tax credits, and $49,738,047 of tax-exempt bond cap to finance the new construction of 203 units of housing, consisting of 201 restricted rental units and 2 unrestricted manager's units.",
